A L G O L - Г Д P
    (7.01.82)

     1.     ′BEGIN′
     2.         ′COMMENT′ TYPE ERRORS;
     3.         ′INTEGER′ I;
     4.         ′REAL′ X;
     5.         ′BOOLEAN′ B;
     6.         I := ′TRUE′;
     7.         B := 1;
     8.         X := B + 1;
     9.         ′IF′ X ′THEN′ I := 0;
    10.         B := I ′AND′ B;
    11.     ′END′
    12.     ′EOP′
TYPE ERROR IN CONNECTION WITH BOOLEAN OP. NEXT STATEMENT IS   11/ 1
TYPE ERROR IN CONNECTION WITH ′IF′. NEXT STATEMENT IS    9/ 2
TYPE ERROR IN CONNECTION WITH ′+′. NEXT STATEMENT IS    9/ 1
ILLEGAL USE OF IDENTIFIER ′B′. NEXT STATEMENT IS    8/ 1
ILLEGAL USE OF IDENTIFIER ′I′. NEXT STATEMENT IS    7/ 1
 * * INCORRECT ALGOL PROGRAM * *
